<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS FROM WTA TOUR CHASE CHAMPIONSHIPS ON FRIDAY.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS FROM WTA TOUR CHASE CHAMPIONSHIPS ON FRIDAY.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $2 million WTA Tour Chase Championships on Friday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Quarter-finals</p>
<p>5-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) beat 3-Arantxa Sanchez Vicario (Spain) 6-0 6-3</p>
